    {
      "version": "1.0.7",
      "releaseNotes": "Shop & Coins\n\nNew Shop in Settings: spend coins on marbles and card-table chips\nEarn coins by beating personal-best score milestones in any game\nCoin-earning guide and spending history in the Shop\nCard Stakes\n\nBig Two, Dou Dizhu, President, Mahjong: choose a chip stake before each hand\nFever Spin uses the shared chip balance for bets\nQuitting mid-hand forfeits your stake; re-enter to place a new bet\nPolish\n\nMarble tips updated: buy marbles with coins in Settings → Shop\nEndless games now show Mode ∞ instead of Clears / Wins",
